s-sectional surveys of nationally representative samples of the noninstitutionalized U.S. civilian population\"}]}, {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"this report treated survey cycle as a continuous variable in linear regression models.\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"this report treated survey cycle as a continuous variable in linear regression models\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The inverse value of the estimated variance from post-stratified weights was used to account for the complex survey design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Energy intake–adjusted sodium intake was estimated using the residual method\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All statistical analyses were performed using SAS-callable SUDAAN (version 11.0.3; RTI International), and p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}